      "id": "claim_ab3bf72f1bde4d8a9b2220b56b4d9c76",
      "statement": "The statement sent to Memgraph is rebuilt from the parsed tokens (comments stripped, token adjacency kept), so the service and the database see the same text; keywords inside comments or strings can neither hide nor create clauses.",
