      "id": "claim_4f1259f80ec64c9f9dd193b02fd7c685",
      "statement": "MemoryLimitError is surfaced distinctly: the Reader raises it when Memgraph reports 'memory limit exceeded' (the plain exception also stops the driver's retry of transient errors), and Runner.run maps it to HTTP 422 'query exceeded the memory limit of …', separate from the timeout and unavailable-database responses.",
