    {
      "id": "claim_4e328fb8f688417489583eeae5fa102b",
      "statement": "The NL stub (M0, no LLM) uses regex intents from config/query/intents.yaml: patterns must fullmatch the whole normalized question case-insensitively (trailing ?!. and whitespace stripped), named groups become Cypher parameters, every template must pass the guard at Intents load time (startup fails otherwise), and unmatched questions get HTTP 422 listing supported intents. It is the stand-in for the planned LLM single-shot generation with validation and repair (ADR-0009 option B).",
      "evidence": [
