    {
      "id": "claim_3b3365ad82224e5395e1b66ffb0cd897",
      "statement": "Runner.run result/error mapping: MemoryLimitError and TimeoutError (or Neo4jError messages containing 'timeout'/'aborted') → 422, other ClientError → 422 'query rejected by the database', other Neo4jError → 503 'knowledge graph unavailable'; guard rejections are HTTP 422 problem+json; rows are truncated to limit with a truncated flag when limit+1 rows came back.",
