      "id": "claim_f9f572d09a134e1a8b9af32a582c5ffd",
      "statement": "The current M0 implementation has no EXPLAIN validation step despite ADR-0009 describing it for the planned LLM pipeline; the guard instead rejects EXPLAIN/PROFILE as denied keywords, and defense rests on the parse guard plus the read transaction.",
